hint.mosshorn=Mosshorns amble out of the woods toward shade, mossy ground, ferns and a few mushrooms under the trees.
hint.mosshorn.rare=Nobody has yet seen a mosshorn rarer than the rest.
hint.turkey=Turkeys strut over to open grass with a fence or log to perch on and a trough of corn.
hint.turkey.rare=Nobody has yet seen a turkey rarer than the rest.
